    <ferc:AttestationName id="f-319" contextRef="c-02">T.J. Winczewski</ferc:AttestationName>
    <ferc:AttestationTitle id="f-320" contextRef="c-02">Vice President</ferc:AttestationTitle>
    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-322" contextRef="c-02">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Enterprise Lou-Tex NGL Pipeline L.P. (&amp;quot;Lou-Tex&amp;quot;) is a Texas limited partnership and a consolidated subsidiary of Enterprise Products Partners L.P. (&amp;quot;EPD&amp;quot;), a Delaware partnership, through the 99% interest held by Enterprise Products Operating LLC (&amp;quot;EPOLLC&amp;quot;), a Texas limited liability company and the 1% interest held by HSC Pipeline Partnership, LLC, a Texas limited liability company. EPOLLC is the operator of Lou-Tex.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Description of the Property&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Lou-Tex is a bi-directional natural gas liquids (&amp;quot;NGL&amp;quot;) pipeline that is approximately 200 miles in length.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The pipeline extends from certain of EPD's Louisiana gas processing plants and underground storage facilities to EPD's Mont Belvieu, Texas NGL fractionation facility.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements conform to those required by FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Financial statements are prepared on the accrual basis of accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Property, plant and equipment assets are recorded at original cost.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Lou-Tex's revenues are derived primarily from transportation of NGLs under tariffs regulated by the FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The tariffs specify the amounts to be paid by shippers for service between receipt and delivery locations and the general terms and conditions of transportation services on the pipeline system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Revenues are recorded upon delivery of products to customers.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Lou-Tex is a limited partnership that passes income tax liability through the partnership to the partners and does not recognize this liability on the partnership's financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;For purposes of calculating the income tax expense and liability for the annual cost of service (shown on page 700 of the annual report) Lou-Tex employs FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Lou-Tex has no employees of its own.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;All operations, management, and administrative functions are performed by employees of Enterprise Products Company on behalf of EPOLLC as operator.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Lou-Tex reimburses EPOLLC for management and administrative functions under the terms of an operating agreement.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;br style="page-break-before: always; clear: both" /&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
    <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-324" contextRef="c-02">&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.71pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.71pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.71pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.71pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;5)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.71pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
